  "title": "PFAS Contamination in Thornton-Cleveleys: Residents Face Growing Concerns Over ‘Forever Chemicals’",
  "summary": "Residents in Thornton-Cleveleys, Lancashire, are facing renewed concerns over possible exposure to PFAS, a group of chemicals commonly known as “forever chemicals”. Dozens of people in the area are undergoing blood testing after investigations found traces of PFOA in soil around properties near a former chemical manufacturing site. The situation has raised questions about long-term environmental contamination, homegrown food and the potential health implications of PFAS exposure. What Is Happ",
